    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Jump, Escape \u2013 But Never Fall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELETE</strong> is a high-speed parkour platformer that tests your reflexes, timing, and precision. Dodge deadly traps, master gravity-defying obstacles, and race through uniquely themed maps designed to push your limits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/b0495ec29474b140a755db09ff8797f6.avif?t=1751979324\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span>\ud83c\udf0d Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes:</strong> Dash across the Moon, sprint through Ancient Egypt, leap through a cartoon world, and navigate a neon-drenched cyberpunk city \u2013 each with its own unique visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Levels:</strong> Carefully crafted obstacle courses designed to challenge both casual and hardcore players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete for the fastest times and climb to the top of the global rankings with full Steam leaderboard integration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement System:</strong> Enjoy smooth parkour mechanics including double jumps, wall runs, and more for a seamless experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Variety:</strong> Every map features a distinct artistic identity \u2013 from minimalism to mythology \u2013 offering a fresh experience every time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.poster.avif?t=1751979324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.webm?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.mp4?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83e\udde0 Who\u2019s It For?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for speedrunners, challenge seekers, and players who live for &quot;just one more try&quot; moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Are You Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your first step and push your limits in the world of DELETE. Every second counts!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/0696e6f11d1a3813ab4a4fd896d3ecf7.poster.avif?t=1751979324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/0696e6f11d1a3813ab4a4fd896d3ecf7.webm?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/0696e6f11d1a3813ab4a4fd896d3ecf7.mp4?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Jump, Escape \u2013 But Never Fall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELETE</strong> is a high-speed parkour platformer that tests your reflexes, timing, and precision. Dodge deadly traps, master gravity-defying obstacles, and race through uniquely themed maps designed to push your limits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/b0495ec29474b140a755db09ff8797f6.avif?t=1751979324\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span>\ud83c\udf0d Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes:</strong> Dash across the Moon, sprint through Ancient Egypt, leap through a cartoon world, and navigate a neon-drenched cyberpunk city \u2013 each with its own unique visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Levels:</strong> Carefully crafted obstacle courses designed to challenge both casual and hardcore players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete for the fastest times and climb to the top of the global rankings with full Steam leaderboard integration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement System:</strong> Enjoy smooth parkour mechanics including double jumps, wall runs, and more for a seamless experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Variety:</strong> Every map features a distinct artistic identity \u2013 from minimalism to mythology \u2013 offering a fresh experience every time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.poster.avif?t=1751979324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.webm?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/f249b1e84db06359e8dcbc0f887348c2.mp4?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83e\udde0 Who\u2019s It For?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for speedrunners, challenge seekers, and players who live for &quot;just one more try&quot; moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Are You Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your first step and push your limits in the world of DELETE. Every second counts!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/0696e6f11d1a3813ab4a4fd896d3ecf7.poster.avif?t=1751979324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/0696e6f11d1a3813ab4a4fd896d3ecf7.webm?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795540/extras/0696e6f11d1a3813ab4a4fd896d3ecf7.mp4?t=1751979324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
